From 37aa5498d440b174e663e3296ddcf1ac43c730dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:22:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ga2: presentation module, filters, 2D/3D aware display,
 dither off

- ga2_present: play-area shape (GA2_ASPECT 4:3/16:9/21:9/fit), 4:3
  picture with black, blurred or skybox sides, integer 2D scaling, window
  title = the game's name per GA2_LANG.
- Filters for 2D scenes only (VU1 activity marks 3D scenes): nearest,
  sharp bilinear, smooth (edge-preserving de-dither), and mpv user shaders
  through ga2_mpv_shader (Anime4K fast/HQ).
- paraLLEl-GS dither off unless GA2_PGS_DITHER=1.
- On-screen pad only with GA2_ONSCREEN_PAD=1; dialogue Auto button stays
  recognised while auto mode is on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
